---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Local Sri Lanka Guides & Dambadiva Guidance | Saumya Tours"
  description="Request a local guide for Sri Lanka sightseeing or tour leadership for a Dambadiva pilgrimage. Discuss language, pace, and group needs with Saumya Tours."
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Guides', href: '/guides' }]}
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Guides</p>
      <h1>See the place. Understand the story.</h1>
      <p>Make your journey more personal with local knowledge, realistic pacing, and room for the questions that matter to your group.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container guide-options">
      <article>
        <img src="/images/sigiriya.webp" alt="Sigiriya rock fortress in Sri Lanka" width="800" height="560" loading="lazy" />
        <div>
          <h2>A local guide for your island journey.</h2>
          <p>
            Planning a day around Colombo, a Cultural Triangle visit, or a longer Sri Lanka route? Tell us your interests and preferred language. We will discuss guide arrangements that fit your plans.
          </p>
          <ul class="inclusion-list">
            <li>Culture, heritage, wildlife, and local food interests</li>
            <li>Pickup, vehicle coordination, and daily timings</li>
            <li>Language, walking pace, and family requirements</li>
          </ul>
          <button class="button button-primary" data-inquire="Local Sri Lanka guide request">Ask for a local guide</button>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article>
        <img src="/images/dambadiva.webp" alt="Pilgrims at the Mahabodhi Temple in Bodh Gaya" width="800" height="560" loading="lazy" />
        <div>
          <h2>Guidance for your Dambadiva pilgrimage.</h2>
          <p>
            Explore routes through Bodh Gaya, Sarnath, Kushinagar, and Lumbini. Discuss tour leadership, worship time, meals, assistance, and daily pace for your chosen departure.
          </p>
          <p>Guide languages and spiritual leadership depend on the arrangement. Confirm those details with our team in writing before booking.</p>
          <a class="button button-primary" href="/dambadiva-tours">Explore Dambadiva journeys</a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-stone">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-intro">
        <h2>Start with what matters to your group.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="values-grid">
        <div class="value">
          <h3>Your interests</h3>
          <p>Tell us whether you are traveling for heritage, Buddhist pilgrimage, wildlife, food, or a balanced mix.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value">
          <h3>Your comfort</h3>
          <p>Discuss walking distances, rest time, mobility support, and dietary preferences early in the plan.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value">
          <h3>Written clarity</h3>
          <p>Confirm guide registration details where relevant, language, working hours, transport, fees, and exclusions in writing.</p>
          <a href="/news/choosing-a-local-tour-guide-sri-lanka" class="text-link">Read our guide checklist</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
